CleanFire Launcher — Fire OS port

Based on Material TV Launcher by 0xRampey and contributors:
https://github.com/0xRampey/material-tv-launcher
Upstream baseline: eccdc92 (v0.1.4).
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

This fork modifies application identity, Android 11 build compatibility,
app discovery, lifecycle handling and installation behavior for Fire OS.
The original Java interface, Material styling and animations are retained.

Includes material-color-utilities by Google and contributors (Apache 2.0).
See third_party/material-color-utilities/LICENSE and README.md for provenance.
Includes Google Sans Flex (SIL Open Font License 1.1).
See assets/fonts/GoogleSansFlex-OFL.txt and GoogleSansFlex-TRADEMARKS.md.

